[stderr] +## Foundation contracts
[stderr] +
[stderr] +### FDN-01 — Bootstrap the reproducible project baseline
[stderr] +
[stderr] +- **Scope / target:** Shared build and test baseline for responsive web and
[stderr] +  PWA; no gameplay or PWA cache implementation.
[stderr] +- **Bounded outcome:** An approved engine/framework project skeleton has one
[stderr] +  documented bootstrap command, deterministic test command, lint/format
[stderr] +  commands, and the planned source/test directory boundaries.
