[stderr] +- **Owns:** Root build/tooling configuration; `src/{core,content,platform/web,app}/`;
[stderr] +  `tests/{core,content,platform,app}/`; `docs/development.md`.
[stderr] +- **Does not own:** Domain rules, content, persistence implementation, UI,
[stderr] +  service worker, hosting, or a browser support promise.
[stderr] +- **Verification:** Clean checkout/bootstrap succeeds in the approved runtime;
[stderr] +  formatting and lint commands pass; a deterministic core sample test runs.
[stderr] +- **Acceptance evidence:** Pinned toolchain/version declaration, documented
[stderr] +  command transcript, and CI-equivalent check output.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +### FDN-02 — Declare configuration and environment boundaries
[stderr] +
[stderr] +- **Scope / target:** Shared release configuration with Web/PWA build inputs;
[stderr] +  no remote runtime configuration or secrets.
[stderr] +- **Bounded outcome:** Typed, validated build configuration separates public
[stderr] +  release metadata from development-only settings, fails closed for absent or
[stderr] +  malformed required values, and prevents client-secret inclusion.
[stderr] +- **Dependencies:** FDN-01; approved release/versioning and hosting inputs.
[stderr] +- **Owns:** Root configuration schema/loader; checked-in example configuration;
[stderr] +  build-time environment documentation; release metadata interface.
[stderr] +- **Does not own:** Account credentials, telemetry endpoints, feature flags for
[stderr] +  unapproved services, or values for undecided vendors/hosts.
[stderr] +- **Verification:** Valid sample configuration builds; missing/invalid required
[stderr] +  value fails with actionable output; release artifact scan finds no secret-like
[stderr] +  configured value.
[stderr] +- **Acceptance evidence:** Configuration contract, sample file, negative-test
[stderr] +  fixtures, and an artifact-scan report.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +### FDN-03 — Establish architecture seams and dependency rules
[stderr] +
[stderr] +- **Scope / target:** Shared core/content/application boundaries plus Web and
[stderr] +  PWA adapter boundaries.
[stderr] +- **Bounded outcome:** Enforced imports/interfaces ensure the deterministic
[stderr] +  core has no browser, renderer, timer, or network dependency; UI and input
[stderr] +  submit commands only; persistence serializes confirmed core state only.
[stderr] +- **Dependencies:** FDN-01; FDN-02 for build-time enforcement configuration.
[stderr] +- **Owns:** `src/core/` public command/state/event interfaces; boundary/lint
[stderr] +  rules; adapter interface definitions; architecture decision documentation.
[stderr] +- **Does not own:** Concrete combat, exploration, UI panels, storage driver,
[stderr] +  service worker, or content package data.
[stderr] +- **Verification:** Dependency-rule test rejects forbidden core imports; a
[stderr] +  fixture adapter can submit an action and render returned state/events without
[stderr] +  direct state mutation.
[stderr] +- **Acceptance evidence:** Dependency graph/check output, public-interface
[stderr] +  inventory, and passing adapter fixture test.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +### FDN-04 — Define semantic design-token contracts
[stderr] +
[stderr] +- **Scope / target:** Shared visual/accessibility semantics, with responsive
[stderr] +  Web layout use and PWA inheriting the same tokens.
[stderr] +- **Bounded outcome:** Original, named tokens cover restrained warm-fantasy
[stderr] +  colour roles, typography scale, spacing, radii, elevation, focus, motion,
[stderr] +  touch target, status, and non-colour state cues; tokens support text scaling,
[stderr] +  contrast modes, reduced motion, and captions without asserting final art.
[stderr] +- **Dependencies:** FDN-01; accessibility acceptance criteria; final font and
[stderr] +  contrast targets remain approval gates.
[stderr] +- **Owns:** `src/app/design/tokens/`; token documentation; token validation or
[stderr] +  preview fixtures.
[stderr] +- **Does not own:** Screens, maps, copied reference styling, art/audio assets,
[stderr] +  final responsive breakpoints, or gameplay UI implementation.
[stderr] +- **Verification:** Token build/type validation passes; sample semantic states
[stderr] +  retain a text label and non-colour cue; reduced-motion values remove or bound
[stderr] +  non-essential animation.
[stderr] +- **Acceptance evidence:** Token inventory with role rationale, original-style
[stderr] +  provenance note, and automated validation/sample capture.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +### FDN-05 — Model deterministic campaign data and commands
[stderr] +
[stderr] +- **Scope / target:** Shared, browser-free domain model for both delivery
[stderr] +  surfaces.
[stderr] +- **Bounded outcome:** Immutable campaign state, typed commands/results/events,
[stderr] +  revisions, interaction IDs, deterministic RNG state, and invariant helpers
[stderr] +  define legal transitions without implementing later feature state machines.
[stderr] +- **Dependencies:** FDN-01 and FDN-03; party size and content quantities are
[stderr] +  approval gates for any concrete shape beyond the minimum contract.
[stderr] +- **Owns:** `src/core/{state,commands,events,invariants,rng}/` and
[stderr] +  `tests/core/contract.*`.
